msgid "⟪k:0⟫The question... ⟪k:1⟫of what I am."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫La question... ⟪k:1⟫de mon identité."

#: scenario9:scenario9_CAE2958D_3138_4A74_BE43_EB9F4F99CF1A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
