#: scenario9:scenario9_3E50B9A6_CAE2_4F7F_8B64_AC4D3DF8CAE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b79141aa23917be607eeae50d81da81272201d122a159f68d56e5f990fc8d4da
#. default-sha256: 8dd7da7bb872ca81387867e71dad93e2eb2a1d95cd703713e5b6424864972e55
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_3E50B9A6_CAE2_4F7F_8B64_AC4D3DF8CAE5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was, as you ascertained, created by Morgana’s mind as it broke down in that tower."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je suis une création, comme tu l’as compris, de l’esprit détraqué de Morgana alors qu’elle "
"était dans la tour."

#: scenario9:scenario9_E4F254F0_79F2_42C0_A49A_1A604A14E118
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 73f03d5f07cf2279d3aa0cb19dd9a614957f79542719de743854104aedacc629
#. default-sha256: bd2b2c462227852f90054c945917e91843fbae6093af5ef960327a2cd7fa07a9
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_E4F254F0_79F2_42C0_A49A_1A604A14E118"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The fact that she viewed herself as a saint only served to amplify that agony."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Le fait qu’elle se voyait elle-même comme une sainte n’a servi qu’à amplifier cette agonie."

#: scenario9:scenario9_19D976E8_DA0B_4502_90FC_4BD8611A2DAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e29bf8cbe245dc1b49db8eaf3aa43d3bc27db27492f36044fb73e101ca56ec78
#. default-sha256: 0ceb0034bcda99eb5e9ba74757ab76db0607b74b2351704fdea916e10b6f9771
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_19D976E8_DA0B_4502_90FC_4BD8611A2DAD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She wanted to hate them, but her identity would not allow her.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Those two "
"conflicting aspects of her self tore Morgana apart.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She was unable to withstand it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle voulait les haïr, mais son identité ne le lui permettait pas.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ces deux aspects "
"conflictuels, qui luttaient en elle, déchiraient Morgana.⟪k:3⟫ Et elle était incapable d’y "
"résister."

#: scenario9:scenario9_20348580_23F0_480E_B537_06DE51FCD92D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05136f503aed720d66903285c07a62492919d95fd89f8c816bb8e76eb2abc05b
#. default-sha256: 4a67d1af01c32b3ee4dc86eae0f37f5ebd466f6d6ff3110adec1099dc11d6a5d
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_20348580_23F0_480E_B537_06DE51FCD92D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When you came to the mansion and resurrected Morgana,⟪k:1⟫you resurrected me as well. ⟪k:2⟫"
"But I had no “self” at first."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quand tu es venu au manoir et que tu as ressuscité Morgana,⟪k:1⟫tu m’as aussi ressuscitée. "
"⟪k:2⟫Même si je n’avais alors pas d’enveloppe physique."

#: scenario9:scenario9_8F2F6F70_E9CD_4537_BD1D_4E10BA755ECD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38281f0ec4e7d87488d8b70bae26674cfc720ee30610a1c2a09f9b6646902a66
#. default-sha256: 468277ab6db0d73c1f17ce4f31f534d7ec3002d39d128402a5ad982799ae9ef2
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_8F2F6F70_E9CD_4537_BD1D_4E10BA755ECD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was, I suppose, not much different than the particles of dust floating around the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je n’étais, j’imagine, en rien différente des particules de poussière qui flottaient dans le "
"manoir."

#: scenario9:scenario9_345DE38B_7BBA_447C_85FD_38908279F629
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 690ccf9ff53e890686d50b143d8fb44321a44478ec6cfff6e79b49c1d8db7a8b
#. default-sha256: 0e900ce569b8636e1aecf9369d1f22176c469042fd39da9703c2ba420c07c830
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_345DE38B_7BBA_447C_85FD_38908279F629"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and descended into the realm of man and the fate which governs it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫et descendit dans le royaume des mortels gouverné par le destin."

#: scenario9:scenario9_3E9DBD4F_9BD0_4586_B216_C3C3AD288452
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 51d8fea0906ee929ba7565404fb2a8ec84547814f6d5857c711e4d7cca1de5fa
#. default-sha256: 96ea2ba4edbe95ef1c29439ee2133bbb6fdf8da458068856f54d7ad9b060fd07
msgctxt "scenario9:scenario9_3E9DBD4F_9BD0_4586_B216_C3C3AD288452"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What do you think the first thing a new soul wishes for when it is born, Michel?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫À⟪k:2⟫ ton avis, quelle est la première chose qu’une âme nouvelle souhaite à sa "
"naissance, Michel ?"

#: scenario9:scenario9_CB0407A9_E339_4D48_B7DA_0AE8D959EE69
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f9ea9a11f52aac864c0c4dcde8247b50df9edc6ca55f284bcdb8dd80e7eb1a6
