#: scenario9:scenario9_D4862E8D_0992_442C_82B4_6E6CBBB09432
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f80c2cbc5654e142039ca059bd0c73b025ef561c072d662eb8dd9811b5fd01d6
